import Mathlib
import PEqualNP.Defs

/-!
L-meta-1495. The file may build on `PEqualNP.Defs` alone, so it carries what it uses:

* the cleaning of a circuit and the deletion of an unread gate, from the merged file
  `L_meta_1004.lean` of this repository (lemmas up to `del_gate`, namespace changed only);
* the model bridge of L-meta-1527 (`bridge`).

New here: redirecting the reads of a wire to an equal earlier wire (`re_wires`), the deletion
kept AND/OR (`del_gate_m`), `shrink`, and the final theorem.
